# Embedding configuration (placeholders only; copy values into your local .env by hand).
# Do NOT copy .env_sample over .env: its placeholder MASTER_KEY bricks the keypair.
# Env names are the ones the code reads: db_layer/embeddings/embeddings_core.py and
# utils/embedding_config.py (EMBED_PROVIDER, EMBED_MODEL, EMBED_DIMENSIONS,
# EMBED_BASE_URL, EMBED_API_KEY, EMBED_PROFILE). docker-compose.yml forwards them
# to the whiskers-agent container.

# --- Default: multimodal embeddings from the compose `embed` sidecar ---------
# Start it with: docker compose up -d embed   (needs an NVIDIA GPU + container toolkit)
# llama.cpp serves google/embeddinggemma-2 (Q8_0 + mmproj) on /v1/embeddings.
EMBED_PROVIDER=gemma-multimodal
EMBED_BASE_URL=http://embed:8080/v1
EMBED_MODEL=embeddinggemma-2
EMBED_DIMENSIONS=768
# The sidecar needs no key. Leave unset unless a gateway in front of it requires one.
# EMBED_API_KEY=
# The SSRF-safe transport blocks private hosts: the in-network sidecar needs this opt-in.
# CAT_ALLOW_LOCAL_PROXIES=1

# --- Legacy alternative: LM Studio, text-only (no image/audio) ---------------
# Load Qwen3 Embedding 0.6B in LM Studio, enable its server on port 1234, then
# comment out the block above and uncomment these. Vectors are 1024-wide and live in
# a different embedding space than embeddinggemma-2: re-index after switching.
# EMBED_PROVIDER=openai
# EMBED_MODEL=text-embedding-qwen3-embedding-0.6b
# EMBED_DIMENSIONS=1024
# EMBED_BASE_URL=http://host.docker.internal:1234/v1
# EMBED_PROFILE=lmstudio
